# 🛍️ Retail Chain Sales Analysis | MySQL + Power BI

An end-to-end **Retail Chain Sales Analysis project** focused on transforming raw retail transaction data into actionable business insights using **MySQL and Power BI**. 📊

The project covers the complete analytics workflow — from **data exploration, cleaning, SQL-based business analysis, and data modeling** to **DAX calculations and interactive Power BI dashboard development**.

The final dashboard provides a 360° view of **sales performance, profitability, customers, products, stores, regions, payment methods, and sales trends**.

