## 🎨 UI Design & Theme

The dashboard uses a **light blue primary theme** to maintain a clean and professional appearance. To experiment with different visual styles and improve visual emphasis, **orange accents** were incorporated across individual dashboard pages.

The combination of **light blue and orange** creates contrast while maintaining consistency, helping important KPIs, trends, and business insights stand out clearly. 🎨📊

