## 🧮 DAX & Data Modeling

Power BI's **DAX** was used to create analytical measures and KPIs including:

* 💰 Total Revenue
* 💵 Total Profit
* 📅 Previous Year Revenue
* 📅 Previous Year Profit
* 📈 Revenue Growth %
* 📊 Profit Growth %
* 🧾 Total Orders
* 🛒 Average Order Value
* 👥 Average Customer Spend
* 💳 Average Spend per Transaction
* 🆕 New Customer Metrics

These calculations enabled **year-over-year comparisons, KPI tracking, and deeper business analysis**.

