## 🔎 Key Business Insights

📈 **Revenue increased by approximately 54% YoY**, reaching **₹15.4M** compared with **₹9.96M** previously.

💰 **Profit reached ₹5M**, compared with **₹3.14M** in the previous year.

🇷🇺 **Russia emerged as the highest-revenue country**, making it an important market for the business.

🏬 **MegaMart** was the strongest-performing store, contributing approximately **₹3.16M in revenue**.

🛍️ **Accessories** was the leading category, generating approximately **₹2M revenue across 556 orders**.

⭐ **Brittny** emerged as the highest-value customer, generating approximately **₹153K revenue across 50 orders**.

👥 Customers aged **50–60** represented the largest demographic segment.

💳 **Credit Card and Cash** were among the most popular payment methods.

